    "passive": {
        "name": "众志一心",
        "abilityIconPath": "/lol-game-data/assets/ASSETS/Characters/Naafiri/HUD/Icons2D/Icons_Naafiri_P.png",
        "abilityVideoPath": "champion-abilities/0950/ability_0950_P1.webm",
        "abilityVideoImagePath": "champion-abilities/0950/ability_0950_P1.jpg",
        "description": "纳菲利召唤出族群。在她对目标进行普攻或施放技能后，族群也会一同攻击。"
    },
    "spells": [
        {
            "spellKey": "q",
            "name": "冥血匕首",
            "abilityIconPath": "/lol-game-data/assets/ASSETS/Characters/Naafiri/HUD/Icons2D/Icons_Naafiri_Q.png",
            "abilityVideoPath": "champion-abilities/0950/ability_0950_Q1.webm",
            "abilityVideoImagePath": "champion-abilities/0950/ability_0950_Q1.jpg",
            "cost": "@Cost@ @AbilityResourceName@",
            "cooldown": "@Cooldown@ 秒 %i:cooldown%",
            "description": "纳菲利投出最多两柄匕首，每柄匕首可造成流血效果。如果目标已经处于流血状态，则造成额外伤害。<br><br>族群成员高高跃起，攻击被此技能命中的英雄。<br>",
            "dynamicDescription": "纳菲利投出冥血侵蚀的匕首，造成<physicalDamage>@spell.NaafiriQ:TotalDamageFirstCast@物理伤害</physicalDamage>并施加流血效果，在@spell.NaafiriQ:BleedDuration@秒内造成<physicalDamage>@spell.NaafiriQ:TotalBleedDamage@物理伤害</physicalDamage>。<br><br>纳菲利可以<recast>再次施放</recast>此技能。如果被击中的敌人已被此技能附加了流血状态，转而造成剩余流血伤害外加<physicalDamage>@spell.NaafiriQ:TotalMinDamageSecondCast@</physicalDamage> 至<physicalDamage>@spell.NaafiriQ:TotalMaxDamageSecondCast@物理伤害</physicalDamage>（数值基于敌人缺失的生命值）。如果目标为英雄或大型野怪，纳菲利回复<healing>@spell.NaafiriQ:TotalHealSecondCast@生命值</healing>。<br><br><keywordMajor>族群</keywordMajor>会跃向被击中的首个英雄并进行攻击，持续@spell.NaafiriP:PackmateTauntDuration@秒。<br><br>@SpellModifierDescriptionAppend@",
